  "w": "06-ai.js:957"
 },
 {
  "k": "The crowd above never sees the roads below.",
  "w": "06-ai.js:1038"
 },
 {
  "k": "{0} throws the Rete over {1}. It loses its movement next turn.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:159"
 },
 {
  "k": "Command {0}: move it, attack an adjacent enemy, or finish.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:174"
 },
 {
  "k": "{0} is walked to the gate first, arms raised to the crowd.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:403"
 },
 {
  "k": "Handlers with nets and long poles herd the surviving beasts out through the beast gates.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:419"
 },
 {
  "k": "Boatmen pole across the flooded arena, fishing out every token — some of them bite.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:442"
 },
 {
  "k": "The sluices open: the sea drains out of the arena, corner to corner, and the sand comes back.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:462"
 },
 {
  "k": "A hush falls. Through the Porta Libitinensis stalks a masked figure in <b>Charun's</b> likeness, a long iron hook in hand — come for <b>{0}</b>, as the Fates decreed.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:484"
 },
 {
  "k": "{0} is dragged from the sand, hook under the arm, heels carving a line in the sand.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:498"
 },
 {
  "k": "Slaves wheel small carts onto the sand and heave the fallen aboard.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:527"
 },
 {
  "k": "Chained slaves shuffle across the sand with rags and rakes, wiping away the day’s blood.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:562"
 },
 {
  "k": "Boys with baskets gather the laurels and flowers the crowd threw.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:586"
 },
 {
  "k": "The crew sweeps the sand for what the fighters left behind — dropped kit, offerings, thrown steel — every scrap carried to the vaults.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:615"
 },
 {
  "k": "The crews unstep the ships’ masts and drag them out — the sand is being set for Classic games.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:669"
 },
 {
  "k": "The crew hauls away the stone that does not belong.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:669"
 },
 {
  "k": "Teams of slaves carry out twelve pillars and set them on the Classic marks, fresh Blessings pots chained above.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:683"
 },
 {
  "k": "Teams of slaves heave the fallen pillars back onto their plinths and chain fresh Blessings pots above.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:683"
 },
 {
  "k": "Fresh Blessings pots are chained atop the pillars.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:701"
 },
 {
  "k": "Below the sand, the winches turn: the spikes sink back into their housings.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:728"
 },
 {
  "k": "The Arena Chest is carried back to its mark.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:744"
 },
 {
  "k": "The ushers work the tiers: the last spectators drain out through the vomitoria, still arguing about the card.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:762"
 },
 {
  "k": "Last of all, the handlers lead the beasts back in and walk them to their marks.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:791"
 },
 {
  "k": "The games are done. The Porta Triumphalis opens for the living; the crew of the arena takes the sand.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:912"
 },
 {
  "k": "The sand is raked smooth, the ropes come down to open the full square, the pillars stand dressed, and the beast gates are barred. The arena waits for its next games.",
  "w": "07-ui.js:962"
 },
